    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/481aaf3aeca7ee6a73b6dafdb372bc1e.poster.avif?t=1705926037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/481aaf3aeca7ee6a73b6dafdb372bc1e.webm?t=1705926037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/481aaf3aeca7ee6a73b6dafdb372bc1e.mp4?t=1705926037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Take part in exciting kart races in Kart Life!</strong><br>You can compete in exciting and challenging races with players from all over the world, upgrade your racing karts, train your agility and concentration to win. Well, start your engines and let's go!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/05c735a8d6c6736bd570477b5fb6202b.poster.avif?t=1705926037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/05c735a8d6c6736bd570477b5fb6202b.webm?t=1705926037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/05c735a8d6c6736bd570477b5fb6202b.mp4?t=1705926037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore race tracks!</strong><br>Master challenging tracks to improve your skills and leave your opponents behind. Knowing how to enter corners correctly will make you truly unbeatable. Upgrade your kart to do even better!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492910/extras/4541cd2ef790cac0ab1764fe3dce3613.poster.avif?t=1705926037\" ><source src=\